 "notes": "red #C44632 war banner, 4.6 wide, hanging from y 13.2 (under the crossbar) to a zigzag lower edge: a flat centre field (x -1.7 .. 1.7, front at z -0.5 like today) and 2 pleats per side (ridges at x +-2.0 standing 0.16 forward, valleys at the edges). Rows: a darker sleeve hem (x0.8) at the top, today's cyan #3CAABE stripe (y 11.1 .. 12.1), red below. Lower edge: 7 teeth (centre point at y 2.9 = today's ClothTail tip, then 3.9 / 4.45 / 4.9 outward), every tooth edge trimmed with a gold #FFC93C band (0.2 wide on the centre teeth, 0.09 on the narrow pleat teeth) on both sides. Stitched emblem on the centre field (front only, like today): a dark red #8D3224 patch diamond (half-diagonal 1.58), today's gold diamond (half-diagonal 1.3, today 1.41), a small cyan centre diamond, 12 cream #E8E2D0 running stitches round the gold.",
